        "AbstractText": "Sexual health encompasses many aspects other than sexual intercourse. Talking about it with patients requires professionals to distance themselves from their own representations. Nurses, often confronted directly or indirectly with this issue, feel helpless. Sexology counselling can offer some answers to these difficulties."
